  "description": "Determine if you can visit all rooms starting from room 0, given that each room contains keys to other rooms.",
  "pseudocode": "function canVisitAllRooms(rooms) {\n  let visited = new Set([0]);\n  let stack = [0];\n  while (stack.length > 0) {\n    let curr = stack.pop();\n    for (let key of rooms[curr]) {\n      if (!visited.has(key)) {\n        visited.add(key);\n        stack.push(key);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  return visited.size === rooms.length;\n}",
